<article class="env-lemma" id="0DMA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DMA">Lemma <span data-tag="0DMA">108.8.1</span>.</a> The diagonal of $\mathcal{P}\! \mathit{ic}_{X/B}$ over $B$ is affine and of finite presentation. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      In Quot, Lemma <a href="/tag/0D03" data-tag="0D03">99.10.1</a> we have seen that $\mathcal{P}\! \mathit{ic}_{X/B}$ is an open substack of $\mathcal{C}\! \mathit{oh}_{X/B}$. Hence this follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/0DLY" data-tag="0DLY">108.4.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>